WEBVTT

00:00:07.231 --> 00:00:09.824
Hana.

00:00:11.970 --> 00:00:13.805
Miss Katja.

00:00:13.805 --> 00:00:16.941
So you're finally awake, Hana.

00:00:16.941 --> 00:00:19.143
Huh? I...

00:00:19.143 --> 00:00:21.703
For you to have gotten so injured...

00:00:22.347 --> 00:00:24.415
Don't be so reckless.

00:00:24.415 --> 00:00:25.882
Miss Katja.

00:00:26.317 --> 00:00:28.251
Here's your reward for being so brave.

00:00:46.571 --> 00:00:50.769
Today, I'll let you do whatever you want.

00:00:51.776 --> 00:00:53.011
Okay?

00:00:53.011 --> 00:00:54.808
A-Anything?

00:00:56.147 --> 00:00:57.842
Come on, Hana.

00:00:58.316 --> 00:00:59.749
Who are you?

00:01:00.218 --> 00:01:03.483
There's no way Miss Katja would go from
being the user to the used!

00:01:03.821 --> 00:01:06.824
That woman's been a queen
since the day she was born!

00:01:06.824 --> 00:01:07.992
I see.

00:01:07.992 --> 00:01:11.428
So much for your reward. Oh well.

00:01:16.134 --> 00:01:20.537
This... Sure enough, it's Miss Katja!

00:01:43.661 --> 00:01:45.288
What a pervert.

00:01:49.600 --> 00:01:53.127
You, too, should learn to cooperate.

00:02:03.815 --> 00:02:04.873
Mi.

00:02:10.388 --> 00:02:20.932
Trance, nureta tsumi ga yobu shoudou

00:02:20.932 --> 00:02:25.096
Modokashii aserasareta kodou

00:02:26.104 --> 00:02:29.904
Kimi wa aizu mo mushi datta

00:02:31.309 --> 00:02:36.110
Dandan to ronri ga kuruu to shittete

00:02:36.547 --> 00:02:40.916
Nerau inochi ga moeru

00:02:41.452 --> 00:02:46.624
Isshu no kairaku, itai yo, mune

00:02:46.624 --> 00:02:50.928
Afuresou na seihai

00:02:50.928 --> 00:02:57.435
Shizumare, suberu made wa osaete

00:02:57.435 --> 00:03:04.408
Subete te ni iretai to kimeta, Lilith yo

00:03:04.408 --> 00:03:06.844
Harisakesou, imademo

00:03:06.844 --> 00:03:10.481
Watashi o dakishimete

00:03:10.481 --> 00:03:14.785
Kurushimeru imi o misete

00:03:14.785 --> 00:03:20.691
Owarasero, saigo wa kokoro no kakera sae

00:03:20.691 --> 00:03:25.930
Kimi ga motomeru kyouchi ni wa todokisou ni nai

00:03:25.930 --> 00:03:28.499
I, I, I

00:03:28.499 --> 00:03:31.434
I'm in spiral

00:03:32.003 --> 00:03:34.904
Qwaser of Stigmata II

00:03:37.308 --> 00:03:40.641
The Cage of Thorns

00:03:49.120 --> 00:03:50.246
Ma'am?

00:03:50.788 --> 00:03:55.782
Are you all right? You look a little pale.

00:03:56.360 --> 00:03:58.029
It's nothing.

00:03:58.029 --> 00:04:00.293
More importantly, have you seen Tsubasa?

00:04:00.731 --> 00:04:03.359
No, I haven't seen her today?

00:04:04.569 --> 00:04:05.627
Oh.

00:04:10.007 --> 00:04:12.376
It seems the chaos has died down.

00:04:12.376 --> 00:04:14.776
This may take a little time.

00:04:16.981 --> 00:04:18.972
Jeter, what is it?

00:04:20.351 --> 00:04:23.184
Lord Wang-Chen. I'd like to speak with you.

00:04:24.088 --> 00:04:27.387
So, you would your shirk your duty
and return to Magnolia?

00:04:29.827 --> 00:04:32.196
Have you forgotten No. 10
of our Commandments?

00:04:32.196 --> 00:04:35.495
Abandoning one's duty equates death.

00:04:36.434 --> 00:04:38.369
I'm aware of that.

00:04:38.369 --> 00:04:41.964
Someone as inexperienced
as me is incapable of fulfilling her duty.

00:04:44.408 --> 00:04:46.577
Do not worry, Jeter.

00:04:46.577 --> 00:04:50.081
The Magdalene of Thunder is in our grasp.

00:04:50.081 --> 00:04:52.413
All that's left is to activate and extract it.

00:04:53.050 --> 00:04:54.142
But...

00:04:55.286 --> 00:04:58.022
You haven't failed in your duty.

00:04:58.022 --> 00:05:00.391
There's no need to worry yourself over that.

00:05:00.391 --> 00:05:01.517
Lord Wang-Chen...

00:05:09.734 --> 00:05:14.728
My element is far more
advantageous than his. And yet...

00:05:28.152 --> 00:05:30.254
You're lucky, Zelezo.

00:05:30.254 --> 00:05:32.552
If I hadn't come, you would have died.

00:05:33.491 --> 00:05:35.857
Honestly! Also...

00:05:41.599 --> 00:05:47.435
Consciousness has left her body and
can't return. Separation, huh?

00:05:49.006 --> 00:05:54.467
Jeez, people are saddling me with burdens
left and right. What a pain.

00:05:57.782 --> 00:06:00.478
Who asked you to act as my shield?

00:06:01.952 --> 00:06:04.785
You really are an idiot.

00:06:07.758 --> 00:06:11.660
Now then, never minding these useless idiots...

00:06:11.996 --> 00:06:17.491
Those guys have acquired the Magdalene
of Thunder. There's no time to sit by idly.

00:06:19.603 --> 00:06:21.939
Damn you, Alexandra Hell!

00:06:21.939 --> 00:06:24.208
Leaving a helpless young maiden
out and exposed...

00:06:24.208 --> 00:06:25.142
You're the worst!

00:06:25.142 --> 00:06:25.832
Ow!

00:06:27.144 --> 00:06:28.679
Ouch...

00:06:28.679 --> 00:06:29.646
Be careful, you...

00:06:32.149 --> 00:06:34.344
S-So cute!

00:06:34.518 --> 00:06:35.686
Ma'am?

00:06:35.686 --> 00:06:37.176
Wh-What?

00:06:38.656 --> 00:06:41.625
Where is the bathroom?

00:06:43.594 --> 00:06:45.896
What's with that girl, all of a sudden?

00:06:45.896 --> 00:06:48.330
Does she always get lost in places like this?

00:06:49.200 --> 00:06:51.691
Still, she's kinda cute...

00:06:52.002 --> 00:06:56.407
Ma'am, I don't know how to work these buttons.

00:06:56.407 --> 00:06:58.272
What do you not understand?

00:06:58.743 --> 00:07:00.040
Um...

00:07:04.081 --> 00:07:05.912
What are you doing?!

00:07:06.050 --> 00:07:08.644
There's something I'd like to ask you.

00:07:09.553 --> 00:07:10.855
Who are you?

00:07:10.855 --> 00:07:12.523
You're in the sorority, yes?

00:07:12.523 --> 00:07:15.720
What if I am? Let me go, you...

00:07:15.960 --> 00:07:16.722
You..!

00:07:18.329 --> 00:07:20.126
Be quiet a moment.

00:07:23.234 --> 00:07:26.499
Huh. These are rather good, in their own way.

00:07:27.238 --> 00:07:29.638
I want you to point me somewhere.

00:07:30.441 --> 00:07:32.109
Who are..?

00:07:32.109 --> 00:07:35.567
It seems you still don't know your place.

00:07:35.980 --> 00:07:37.811
But the body is straightforward.

00:07:46.257 --> 00:07:47.191
Don't tell me!

00:07:47.191 --> 00:07:51.184
I will teach your body just who you are.

00:07:58.269 --> 00:08:00.737
NOOO!

00:08:04.375 --> 00:08:06.172
Oh, Miss Miyuki!

00:08:12.750 --> 00:08:13.808
Jeter.

00:08:16.020 --> 00:08:18.420
You have some time to talk?

00:08:23.260 --> 00:08:26.093
How unusual that you'd spend time with me.

00:08:27.064 --> 00:08:29.259
Because you were acting strange.

00:08:30.868 --> 00:08:32.699
Sometimes, I long for others.

00:08:34.939 --> 00:08:36.964
They say you're looking for Tsubasa.

00:08:37.775 --> 00:08:39.936
What do you know?

00:08:40.778 --> 00:08:44.805
If you knew where Tsubasa was,
what would you do about it?

00:08:45.349 --> 00:08:47.017
I would save her!

00:08:47.017 --> 00:08:48.917
Save? From what?

00:08:49.954 --> 00:08:51.615
From the bonds of cruelty.

00:08:57.761 --> 00:09:01.219
Wh-What's the point in doing this?

00:09:01.799 --> 00:09:05.462
Just a little entertainment. Ah, perfect timing.

00:09:06.036 --> 00:09:07.671
What's that?

00:09:07.671 --> 00:09:11.375
Your academy is fitted with
the latest equipment, right?

00:09:11.375 --> 00:09:16.745
If I stream some wonderful live footage,
your popularity will skyrocket, right?

00:09:17.047 --> 00:09:19.450
If you do that, there's no way I can stay here!

00:09:19.450 --> 00:09:21.719
I'll blur out some parts.

00:09:21.719 --> 00:09:24.488
Oh, that's good. No, it's not!

00:09:24.488 --> 00:09:25.990
What's bothering you?

00:09:25.990 --> 00:09:26.979
It's just...

00:09:29.393 --> 00:09:33.664
I'll do anything for you.
Just let me go to the toilet.

00:09:33.664 --> 00:09:36.367
Hm. Do anything for me, huh?

00:09:36.367 --> 00:09:38.494
Yes! That's good, right?

00:09:40.838 --> 00:09:43.541
I swear. You lack discipline.

00:09:43.541 --> 00:09:46.237
It looks like I'll have to teach
you from square one.

00:09:46.844 --> 00:09:53.017
If you do anything more, I... I really will pee!

00:09:53.017 --> 00:09:58.822
Huh. Well, I'll be sure to watch, so just do it.

00:09:58.822 --> 00:10:01.926
You should feel honored, that the master
would hear her slave's plea.

00:10:01.926 --> 00:10:04.190
Huh? N-No way!

00:10:07.731 --> 00:10:10.401
Wh-What do you want?

00:10:10.401 --> 00:10:12.703
You know of The Abyss, right?

00:10:12.703 --> 00:10:15.673
The central area in the last layer
of your virtual reality,

00:10:15.673 --> 00:10:18.542
which only those with certain
privileges may enter.

00:10:18.542 --> 00:10:22.012
That place is obviously off limits!

00:10:22.012 --> 00:10:24.913
But sorority members can go in, can't they?

00:10:25.716 --> 00:10:29.243
There's no way I could take a weirdo
like you in with me!

00:10:36.527 --> 00:10:38.929
You still don't get it?

00:10:38.929 --> 00:10:41.432
Your place is that of a slave.

00:10:41.432 --> 00:10:43.297
S-Slave?!

00:10:43.801 --> 00:10:46.201
You WILL guide me there, won't you?

00:10:47.705 --> 00:10:48.639
That's!

00:10:48.639 --> 00:10:51.008
Yes, clever girl.

00:10:51.008 --> 00:10:56.280
It's the love letter you wrote your beloved
Miss Miyuki that you never gave her.

00:10:56.280 --> 00:10:58.373
Stop it! How did you?

00:10:58.949 --> 00:11:00.610
It's a trade secret.

00:11:21.705 --> 00:11:23.730
How cute you are.

00:11:25.776 --> 00:11:30.475
But my, you've done it now.
You really are hopeless.

00:11:31.048 --> 00:11:34.142
I'll become hated.

00:11:34.318 --> 00:11:36.980
You were never that well liked to begin with.

00:11:38.589 --> 00:11:40.819
You're just one among many.

00:11:45.396 --> 00:11:48.832
You're searching for a queen
who will love you, yes?

00:11:49.700 --> 00:11:50.826
What?

00:11:51.502 --> 00:11:53.800
I'll be your "big sister."

00:11:54.772 --> 00:11:56.507
What are you talking about?

00:11:56.507 --> 00:11:58.634
I am your queen.

00:11:59.343 --> 00:12:01.004
You can be that?

00:12:11.655 --> 00:12:13.891
Who do you think I am?

00:12:13.891 --> 00:12:16.291
I shall save you.

00:12:17.761 --> 00:12:20.161
Yes, Sister.

00:12:28.572 --> 00:12:33.305
You'll save her? Is that what Tsubasa wants?

00:12:34.078 --> 00:12:35.545
What are you trying to say?

00:12:36.146 --> 00:12:39.980
That your thinking could be one-sided.

00:12:41.018 --> 00:12:42.679
Even if that's true...

00:12:45.756 --> 00:12:50.090
Even if it's not wanted,
it's something I have to do.

00:12:51.895 --> 00:12:54.955
That's how much you think of Tsubasa, is it?

00:12:55.666 --> 00:12:57.367
I'm jealous.

00:12:57.367 --> 00:12:59.767
But you must give up on Tsubasa.

00:13:00.304 --> 00:13:01.805
What do you mean?

00:13:01.805 --> 00:13:07.505
It's nothing that concerns a civilian.
In this matter, you're an outsider.

00:13:08.245 --> 00:13:11.510
Jeter... Just who are you?

00:13:14.418 --> 00:13:15.715
A Qwaser.

00:13:16.053 --> 00:13:17.145
"Qwaser"?

00:13:17.621 --> 00:13:19.723
Soon, I will complete my duty.

00:13:19.723 --> 00:13:21.281
I won't be seeing you again.

00:13:21.925 --> 00:13:24.917
I wanted to meet you as a friend. Goodbye.

00:13:27.097 --> 00:13:28.086
Jeter...

00:13:29.767 --> 00:13:31.826
I'm not an outsider.

00:13:34.438 --> 00:13:37.896
I'm the only one that can stop Tsubasa.

00:13:45.149 --> 00:13:47.084
He's powerful for sure.

00:13:47.084 --> 00:13:50.454
But I've gone up a Tier and
have gotten stronger, too.

00:13:50.454 --> 00:13:51.944
Why wasn't it enough?

00:13:53.290 --> 00:13:56.282
What is different? What don't I have enough of?

00:13:56.760 --> 00:13:57.594
Sasha.

00:13:57.594 --> 00:13:58.754
Hi, Sasha!

00:13:59.863 --> 00:14:01.694
Mafuyu! Tomo!

00:14:02.266 --> 00:14:05.969
I can't be thinking of you at a time like this.

00:14:05.969 --> 00:14:07.869
I'm in the middle of a mission. Go away!

00:14:08.138 --> 00:14:11.475
Huh? It's not that easy...

00:14:11.475 --> 00:14:12.342
Right?

00:14:12.342 --> 00:14:13.443
Why won't they disappear?

00:14:13.443 --> 00:14:15.646
What do you mean, "disappear"? You're cruel!

00:14:15.646 --> 00:14:19.116
Sasha, your wounds haven't healed yet.

00:14:19.116 --> 00:14:21.949
That's why you still need to rest.

00:14:22.619 --> 00:14:24.288
My wounds are no big deal!

00:14:24.288 --> 00:14:26.056
The wounds in your heart.

00:14:26.056 --> 00:14:26.784
What?

00:14:27.157 --> 00:14:30.092
You've had to dress like a woman
this whole time, right?

00:14:31.795 --> 00:14:36.099
No matter how much you push it, your mind and
body are rebelling, and you won't awaken.

00:14:36.099 --> 00:14:37.999
There's no way I'm that weak!

00:14:38.302 --> 00:14:39.269
Here.

00:14:44.808 --> 00:14:47.174
S-Stop it! Don't look!

00:14:47.978 --> 00:14:49.012
It suits you.

00:14:49.012 --> 00:14:51.648
Let's put some makeup on you.

00:14:51.648 --> 00:14:51.982
Stop! No, don't!

00:14:51.982 --> 00:14:54.051
My, you're so cute.

00:14:54.051 --> 00:14:55.450
I'm a little jealous.

00:14:55.919 --> 00:14:57.819
< Don't look! >

00:14:59.556 --> 00:15:01.183
His wounds aren't that serious.

00:15:01.925 --> 00:15:06.463
A trained Qwaser should be able
to awaken soon.

00:15:06.463 --> 00:15:08.829
But his not awakening means...

00:15:09.633 --> 00:15:12.363
Zelezo was inexperienced?

00:15:14.671 --> 00:15:18.107
Will Ekaterina be able to handle
things on her own?

00:15:32.256 --> 00:15:34.724
What are you gonna do when
we reach the Abyss?

00:15:36.460 --> 00:15:38.826
Wh-What are you doing?

00:15:39.429 --> 00:15:41.732
There's something I want to see.

00:15:41.732 --> 00:15:45.602
You're searching for the girl
who was "separated"?

00:15:45.602 --> 00:15:48.372
Yes. Or, rather, that's part of it.

00:15:48.372 --> 00:15:50.574
If she's there, I guess I could rescue her.

00:15:50.574 --> 00:15:51.268
Come on!

00:15:52.376 --> 00:15:54.745
But it's completely off limits.

00:15:54.745 --> 00:15:56.580
If something happens, don't blame me.

00:15:56.580 --> 00:15:58.715
Enough complaints, just hurry up and do it.

00:15:58.715 --> 00:15:59.850
Hmph!

00:15:59.850 --> 00:16:01.451
Did you say something?

00:16:01.451 --> 00:16:05.114
Uh, n-nothing at all.

00:16:13.230 --> 00:16:14.219
No!

00:16:20.137 --> 00:16:24.699
You're quite stubborn.
What is the need to resist so?

00:16:26.109 --> 00:16:28.078
The High Ancient Circuits...

00:16:28.078 --> 00:16:30.480
Their construction and origins are unknown.

00:16:30.480 --> 00:16:32.744
Thus, they are difficult to control.

00:16:33.717 --> 00:16:40.350
Haruyuki Amano's mistake was in thinking the
Magdalene of Thunder could not be controlled.

00:16:44.561 --> 00:16:49.464
But my silicon circuits,
bundled into a network and the human mind...

00:16:49.866 --> 00:16:52.596
If one possesses such witchcraft...

00:16:58.508 --> 00:17:01.602
Controlling the Magdalene of Thunder
is indeed possible!

00:17:16.526 --> 00:17:21.327
It looks like there's no going back.
I'm sorry, Tsubasa.

00:17:41.151 --> 00:17:42.778
What is this?

00:17:47.024 --> 00:17:47.786
Hana!

00:17:56.166 --> 00:17:59.302
Don't draw near recklessly,
User of the Red Copper Doll.

00:17:59.302 --> 00:18:02.203
Well, look who it is: the loser from yesterday.

00:18:03.140 --> 00:18:06.209
I simply let my guard down.
It won't happen again.

00:18:06.209 --> 00:18:08.973
Fine, then I'll make it so that
you'll never stand again.

00:18:09.312 --> 00:18:13.772
Think you can? In this electronic realm,
you can't use your doll!

00:18:28.532 --> 00:18:29.833
Sister!

00:18:29.833 --> 00:18:31.234
She's risking her life.

00:18:31.234 --> 00:18:32.223
You want to die?!

00:18:35.338 --> 00:18:38.205
To die a warrior would be salvation!

00:18:38.909 --> 00:18:41.810
How naïve. Who the hell would save YOU?

00:18:43.580 --> 00:18:44.478
What's that?!

00:18:44.881 --> 00:18:47.247
Th-Th-The VR has become unstable!

00:18:47.918 --> 00:18:48.907
Lord Wang-Chen!

00:18:50.687 --> 00:18:53.383
It seems his witchcraft has
reached the final stage.

00:18:54.758 --> 00:18:55.884
Witchcraft?

00:18:58.161 --> 00:19:01.722
This means that the Magdalene
of Thunder is ours.

00:19:03.266 --> 00:19:04.699
Sister!

00:19:05.202 --> 00:19:06.794
Ayame, log out!

00:19:07.237 --> 00:19:10.331
Ma'am! Log out... Log out!

00:19:10.574 --> 00:19:11.541
No you don't!

00:19:18.415 --> 00:19:19.211
Ayame!

00:19:22.986 --> 00:19:25.955
Are you an idiot? This will swallow YOU up, too.

00:19:26.923 --> 00:19:28.185
And what of it?

00:19:28.992 --> 00:19:30.186
Bitch!

00:19:43.340 --> 00:19:46.138
At last! I've obtained that High Ancient Circuit...

00:19:46.943 --> 00:19:49.377
The Magdalene of Thunder!

00:20:21.378 --> 00:20:22.436
Tsubasa.

00:20:25.282 --> 00:20:28.080
I promised to protect you, Tsubasa.

00:20:29.452 --> 00:20:31.249
It's my duty.

00:20:32.522 --> 00:20:34.956
I won't let you become some monster!

00:20:44.834 --> 00:20:46.597
I will stop this!

00:20:56.980 --> 00:21:00.643
So it's come, Amano's defense program.

00:21:03.186 --> 00:21:05.017
Everything is according to plan.

00:21:06.189 --> 00:21:10.819
The power of this computer shall be ours!

00:21:24.341 --> 00:21:25.740
My Tsubasa!

00:21:26.042 --> 00:21:29.739
I will save you... Even if I have to kill you!

00:21:48.398 --> 00:21:54.804
Yuraida, hitaishou no kidou

00:21:54.804 --> 00:22:01.311
Jokyoku ni kazashita kousai

00:22:01.311 --> 00:22:07.584
Hikari no shuushisen wa hizunda mama

00:22:07.584 --> 00:22:13.147
Kashika sareta yume o kataru

00:22:15.058 --> 00:22:20.430
Yuuan na kyokou no shin'en ni

00:22:20.430 --> 00:22:26.503
Itsuka torawareta sekai o uchinuke

00:22:26.503 --> 00:22:28.471
Ah, break up the fake, stand in the truth

00:22:28.471 --> 00:22:30.140
And you will die in your sin

00:22:30.140 --> 00:22:33.343
Juuji o kire, fuzai no kami ni

00:22:33.343 --> 00:22:36.980
Kakusei no uta o kanadeshi koe wa

00:22:36.980 --> 00:22:39.816
Boutoku no tsurugi ka?

00:22:39.816 --> 00:22:41.418
Chain up the pain, stand up to sin

00:22:41.418 --> 00:22:43.053
Let no one lead you astray

